{"seq":84,"slug":"probabilistic-data-structures","title":"布隆过滤器与概率数据结构","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/probabilistic-data-structures","rating":{"composite":3.51,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 布隆过滤器与概率数据结构\n\n精确的数据结构总在回答同一句承诺：你问的东西在不在、有几个、有多少种、排第几——我都能给出一字不差的答案。这份承诺的代价是空间随数据规模线性增长。当一张去重表要装下十亿个 URL、当一条流每秒涌入百万条事件、当内存预算只有几十兆，这份精确就成了奢侈。概率数据结构换了一种思路：放弃「一字不差」，只保证「错得可控且可预测」，于是用对数级甚至常数级的空间，换来对成员、基数、频率、分位数的近似答案。这个 hub 讲的就是这门「用少量空间换近似答案」的工程艺术。\n\n整个 hub 沿四条主线层层递进。第一条是[基础](1_foundations/_INTRODUCTION.md)：先想清楚为什么要放弃精确、哈希函数为何是所有这些结构的共同地基、以及空间与精度之间那条无法绕开的权衡曲线。这一章不讲任何具体结构，但它定义的词汇——误判率、独立哈希、信息论下界——会贯穿后面每一篇。\n\n第二条主线是[成员查询](2_membership/_INTRODUCTION.md)，回答最朴素的问题：这个元素见过没有。布隆过滤器是这一族的奠基者，用一个位数组和几个哈希给出「可能在」或「一定不在」的判断；计数布隆与布谷鸟过滤器补上了删除能力；商过滤器则把整个结构搬进连续内存、对缓存友好。三者解决同一个问题，却在删除、缓存、可合并性上各有取舍。\n\n第三条主线是[基数与频率](3_cardinality-frequency/_INTRODUCTION.md)，从「在不在」升级到「有多少」。HyperLogLog 用几 KB 估计上亿量级的不重复计数；Count-Min Sketch 用一张二维计数表估计任意元素的出现频率；Top-K 与重元素算法在此之上找出最热门的那一小撮 key。它们都建立在第一章的哈希之上，又共享同一种「多行取极值消除碰撞偏差」的设计直觉。\n\n第四条主线是[工程实践](4_practice/_INTRODUCTION.md)，把前三章的理论压进真实系统。分位数概要回答「P99 延迟是多少」这类分布问题；系统应用一章梳理这些结构在数据库、缓存、流计算、网络中的落地形态；陷阱与调参则收拢所有踩坑经验——哈希选错、容量估偏、误判率算错、合并语义不一致。读完四章，你应当能在面对一个真实的规模问题时，准确判断哪种近似结构合适、参数怎么定、误差怏么算。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/probabilistic-data-structures/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-probabilistic","title":"为什么用概率数据结构","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/probabilistic-data-structures/foundations/why-probabilistic"},{"seq":2,"slug":"hashing-foundations","title":"哈希基础","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/probabilistic-data-structures/foundations/hashing-foundations"},{"seq":3,"slug":"space-accuracy-tradeoff","title":"空间与精度权衡","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/probabilistic-data-structures/foundations/space-accuracy-tradeoff"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"membership","title":"成员查询","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/probabilistic-data-structures/membership","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"bloom-filters","title":"布隆过滤器","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/probabilistic-data-structures/membership/bloom-filters"},{"seq":2,"slug":"counting-cuckoo","title":"计数与布谷鸟过滤器","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/probabilistic-data-structures/membership/counting-cuckoo"},{"seq":3,"slug":"quotient-filters","title":"商过滤器","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/probabilistic-data-structures/membership/quotient-filters"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"cardinality-frequency","title":"基数与频率","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/probabilistic-data-structures/cardinality-frequency","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hyperloglog","title":"HyperLogLog 基数估计","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/probabilistic-data-structures/cardinality-frequency/hyperloglog"},{"seq":2,"slug":"count-min-sketch","title":"Count-Min Sketch 频率估计","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/probabilistic-data-structures/cardinality-frequency/count-min-sketch"},{"seq":3,"slug":"top-k-heavy-hitters","title":"Top-K 与重元素","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/probabilistic-data-structures/cardinality-frequency/top-k-heavy-hitters"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/probabilistic-data-structures/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"quantiles-sketches","title":"分位数概要","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/probabilistic-data-structures/practice/quantiles-sketches"},{"seq":2,"slug":"systems-applications","title":"系统应用","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/probabilistic-data-structures/practice/systems-applications"},{"seq":3,"slug":"pitfalls-tuning","title":"陷阱与调参","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/probabilistic-data-structures/practice/pitfalls-tuning"}]}]}